                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN FÜR NR-SL-MULTIUNTERKANAL-PSCCH-ÜBERTRAGUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉS DE TRANSMISSION SL NR PAR PSCCH À SOUS-CANAUX MULTIPLES</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHODS FOR NR SL MULTI-SUB-CHANNEL PSCCH TRANSMISSION</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Methods and apparatuses for Sidelink (SL) communication are disclosed herein. A method for SL communication performed by a Wireless Transmit/Receive Unit (WTRU) may comprise receiving a plurality of resources over a Physical Sidelink Control Channel (PSCCH) in a slot. The method may further comprise determining the plurality of resources in the slot are control information resources and a control information resource type associated with the control information resources. The method may further comprise determining a priority of the control information resource type based on a configuration relating priorities to control resource information types. The method may further comprise decoding the PSCCH according to the determined priority of the control information resource type.</p>
            </abstract>
